From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add build-info resource for leavesclip mixin bootstrap

Leavesclip's BuildInfoInjector reads `/META-INF/build-info` from the server jar
when `-Dleavesclip.enable.mixin=true` is used. Without this resource, startup
fails with NPE before server bootstrap.

diff --git a/src/main/resources/META-INF/build-info b/src/main/resources/META-INF/build-info
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..e17f4f6f9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/main/resources/META-INF/build-info
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Leaf	1.21.8	0

-- 
2.43.0
